            "review_title": "Review at Bun Dau Co Hanh",
            "review_text": "Jet04201596829\n3 contributions\n0\nDelicious food, friendly service, northern food, affordable menu, hygienic 🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰\nDec 2023 • Friends\nThe pho here is very delicious but the price is very affordable compared to the general level, many places have higher prices but not as delicious. Northern Pho is authentic, sold in Da Nang, so the restaurant is very thoughtful in serving it with the smell of Chinese and bean sprouts. If you don't like it, tell the restaurant to leave, the space is open. The menu also has bun cha, vermicelli with tofu... will continue to visit next time.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten January 5, 2024",
